1
00:00:03,574 --> 00:00:06,144
哇 怎么回事
Whoa. What's all this?

2
00:00:06,184 --> 00:00:07,614
妈妈听到我们抱怨说好无聊
Mom heard us say we were bored.

3
00:00:07,644 --> 00:00:08,744
衰了吧
Suckers.

4
00:00:08,784 --> 00:00:10,814
她从外面都能听到
She heard us from outside.

5
00:00:10,824 --> 00:00:12,734
她简直有顺风耳 就像导盲犬
She has super good hearing, like a seeing eye dog.

6
00:00:12,734 --> 00:00:16,024
那些狗有过度发达的听力 以此来弥补
They have overdeveloped hearing to make up for the fact that--

7
00:00:16,024 --> 00:00:18,324
等等 导盲犬本身没有瞎
Wait, the dogs aren't blind.

8
00:00:18,364 --> 00:00:20,494
等等 好像是瞎的吧
Wait. Are they?

9
00:00:20,534 --> 00:00:22,804
不对 这样说不通啊
No, that wouldn't make sense.

10
00:00:22,834 --> 00:00:24,154
你说得对
You're right.

11
00:00:24,184 --> 00:00:26,114
只要耐心等待 她自己就能琢磨出答案
If I wait long enough, she can get there by herself.

12
00:00:26,634 --> 00:00:27,234
快猜 姑娘们
Quick, girls--

13
00:00:27,234 --> 00:00:29,504
《月满抱佳人》中著名的丹尼
Famous Danny from "Moonstruck."

14
00:00:30,134 --> 00:00:30,135
艾啰
Aiello?

15
00:00:30,135 --> 00:00:31,444
[丹尼·艾洛 电影演员]
[Danny Aiello]

16
00:00:31,464 --> 00:00:32,785
菲尔 幸好找到你了
Hey, Phil. I'm glad I caught ya.

17
00:00:32,795 --> 00:00:33,755
什么事
What's up?

18
00:00:33,755 --> 00:00:35,935
是关于斯蒂芬和斯特凡的
Uh, it's about Steven and Stefan.

19
00:00:35,975 --> 00:00:37,545
他们想再看一次布洛尔街上的房子
They wanna see that house on Briar again.

20
00:00:37,575 --> 00:00:39,045
真的吗 我都带他们去看过5次了
Really? I showed it to them five times.

21
00:00:39,065 --> 00:00:41,115
上次去看时 我以为他们总算看对眼了呢
Last time we were there, I think they got mail.

22
00:00:41,145 --> 00:00:42,515
所以我才给你打电话啊
Yeah, well, that's why I'm calling.

23
00:00:42,545 --> 00:00:44,735
他们不喜欢去烦别人 只喜欢烦我
They hate upsetting people, unless, of course, it's me.

24
00:00:44,765 --> 00:00:46,345
所以他们才不介意清晨7点就把我闹醒
Then they don't mind waking me up at 7:00 A.M.,

25
00:00:46,385 --> 00:00:47,555
要我给你打电话
asking me to call you.

26
00:00:47,565 --> 00:00:49,055
没问题 反正我也没事
It's no problem. I'm just hanging around.

27
00:00:49,085 --> 00:00:50,555
正好有点闲得无聊
Kind of bored, really.

28
00:00:51,405 --> 00:00:52,405
怎么了
What?

29
00:00:54,235 --> 00:00:56,335
我们今天的日行一善完成了
Well, we did our good deed for the day.

30
00:00:56,355 --> 00:00:58,315
没错 为了我们的死对头 他们有完没完啊
Yeah, for the enemy. Don't they have enough?

31
00:00:58,315 --> 00:01:01,525
我们从一年前就计划领养一个儿子
It's been about a year since we decided to adopt a boy.

32
00:01:01,555 --> 00:01:03,576
同时 我们的朋友斯蒂芬和斯特凡
Meanwhile, our friends Steven and Stefan

33
00:01:03,606 --> 00:01:05,246
也决定要一个孩子
decided that they wanted a baby, too.

34
00:01:05,276 --> 00:01:06,506
好奇他们这念头从哪里偷来的啊
Wonder where they got that idea?

35
00:01:06,506 --> 00:01:09,316
我们还在等待之中 他们却已经
Well, we're still waiting, but they already got their kid

36
00:01:09,316 --> 00:01:11,316
通过代孕生下了孩子
because they went through a surrogate.

37
00:01:11,356 --> 00:01:13,186
他们对此叽叽喳喳个没完
Which is all they talk about.

38
00:01:13,226 --> 00:01:14,536
你要一直这么说话吗
Are you gonna keep doing that?

39
00:01:14,576 --> 00:01:15,796
没准哦
I might.

40
00:01:17,196 --> 00:01:18,226
我得带人去看房子了
I have to go show a house.

41
00:01:18,226 --> 00:01:21,046
不过首先 艾尔顿·约翰在70年代时的性向是
But first, what was Elton John's sexual orientation in the '70s?

42
00:01:21,076 --> 00:01:21,786
拜[音同Bi 双性恋]
Bye.

43
00:01:21,786 --> 00:01:24,296
-你已经说过一次了 -经典永流传
- You've done that one before. - And it never gets old,

44
00:01:24,296 --> 00:01:26,806
就像奇异船长本人一样
like the good Captain Fantastic himself.

45
00:01:27,916 --> 00:01:29,146
克莱尔 你知道吗
Hey, Claire, guess what?

46
00:01:29,186 --> 00:01:30,416
抱歉 亲爱的 我没空说话
I'm sorry, honey, I can't talk right now.

47
00:01:30,446 --> 00:01:32,016
我答应了送贝瑟妮去机场
I told Bethenny I would take her to the airport.

48
00:01:32,056 --> 00:01:34,757
我迟到了 她会赶不上飞机的 钥匙呢
I'm late, and she's gonna miss her flight. Where are my keys?

49
00:01:34,787 --> 00:01:36,287
这椅子怎么还在这 我以为你和卢克
Why is that chair still here? I thought you and Luke

50
00:01:36,327 --> 00:01:37,627
已经把它搬去路边了呢
were gonna put it out on the sidewalk.

51
00:01:37,657 --> 00:01:40,257
你没空说话 却有空要我做家务
So you can't talk unless it's about my chores?

52
00:01:40,297 --> 00:01:43,187
你何不现在把活干好 也免得你这么无聊
Why don't you just do it now, and you won't be so bored?

53
00:01:43,187 --> 00:01:44,817
你刚才听见了
You heard that?

54
00:01:44,817 --> 00:01:46,947
什么都逃不过我耳朵
I hear everything.

55
00:01:49,787 --> 00:01:51,127
是找我的
That's for me.

56
00:01:52,237 --> 00:01:54,747
利昂 小平头真清爽
Hey, Leon. Nice buzz cut.

57
00:01:54,777 --> 00:01:57,047
对某些人来说 洗发水根本没用
Yeah, for some people, the shampoo doesn't work.

58
00:01:57,067 --> 00:01:59,557
只会让头虱越发猖狂
It only makes the lice angry.

59
00:02:00,117 --> 00:02:02,087
很高兴见到你
Nice to see you.

60
00:02:02,477 --> 00:02:04,718
天呐 怎么会这样
Oh, no. No--oh, God.

61
00:02:04,748 --> 00:02:06,718
艾丽克斯 站着别动
Um, Alex, do not move.

62
00:02:06,758 --> 00:02:08,158
海莉 立刻打扫干净 听见了吗
Haley, clean this up, okay?

63
00:02:08,188 --> 00:02:09,858
谁会在花瓶里装满弹子球啊
Who fills a vase with marbles?

64
00:02:09,888 --> 00:02:12,008
谁会看不见一个装满弹子球的花瓶呢
Who doesn't see a vase filled with marbles?

65
00:02:12,038 --> 00:02:13,928
谁想聆听一大叠盘子被打破的乐曲
Who wants to hear a bunch of plates crashing?

66
00:02:13,948 --> 00:02:16,498
菲尔 亲爱的 快来厨房帮帮姑娘们
Phil! Honey, the girls need you in the kitchen!

67
00:02:16,528 --> 00:02:19,968
谢谢你的帽子 利昂 戴着有点痒呢
Thanks for the hat, Leon. It kind of tickles.

68
00:02:19,968 --> 00:02:20,888
菲尔
Phil!

69
00:02:20,888 --> 00:02:23,338
把它救活需要多少电啊
How much electricity do we need to bring this back?

70
00:02:23,378 --> 00:02:24,488
用不着那么高深的知识
It's not rocket science.

71
00:02:24,528 --> 00:02:26,288
我们只是要让只死松鼠复活而已
We're only reanimating a squirrel.

72
00:02:26,328 --> 00:02:28,578
菲尔 事态紧急
Phil! Now!

73
00:02:42,229 --> 00:02:43,959
听起来不错嘛 不 等一下
Sounds great. No, hang on.

74
00:02:43,959 --> 00:02:45,229
歌洛莉亚 曼尼呢
Gloria, where's Manny?

75
00:02:45,259 --> 00:02:47,849
几个邻居小孩邀请他一起去踢橄榄球
Some neighborhood kids have invited him to play football.

76
00:02:47,879 --> 00:02:50,869
他说他去进行晨间散步保健了
He said he was taking his morning constitutional.

77
00:02:50,869 --> 00:02:53,439
他在摆弄他的卡丁车 不过他会去的
He's working on his go-cart, but he'll be there.

78
00:02:53,479 --> 00:02:54,879
好 到时候见
Okay. See you then.

79
00:02:54,909 --> 00:02:57,279
曼尼没法去和他们踢球了
No, Manny cannot go and play with those boys.

80
00:02:57,309 --> 00:03:00,459
玛戈正在帮我们搞下午去剧院的票
Margo is trying to get us theater tickets for this afternoon.

81
00:03:00,459 --> 00:03:01,989
歌洛莉亚 你和曼尼黏得够紧了
Gloria, you and Manny do enough together.

82
00:03:01,989 --> 00:03:04,430
我们让他自己决定吧 他去哪里散步了
Let's let him decide. Where's he walking?

83
00:03:04,460 --> 00:03:06,630
不知道 不过就他哼的歌来看
I don't know. But according to the song he was singing,

84
00:03:06,660 --> 00:03:09,200
大概是在街道的向阳处散步呢
he was going to the sunny side of the street.

85
00:03:09,230 --> 00:03:12,500
再多的话也不足以说明 那孩子多么需要踢橄榄球
I cannot express to you enough how bad this kid needs football.

86
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,470
妈 快看我找到了什么
Mom! Look what I found!

87
00:03:14,470 --> 00:03:16,020
第99个硬币
Number 99!

88
00:03:16,020 --> 00:03:18,610
在曼尼5岁时 我们家境贫穷
When Manny was 5, we didn't have much.

89
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,890
无依无靠
We were on our own.

90
00:03:19,930 --> 00:03:22,610
所以我们总是幻想能中个彩票
So we always dreamed of winning the lottery.

91
00:03:22,610 --> 00:03:25,320
我们想如果收集起100个人像朝上的幸运分币
We figured if we collected 100 lucky heads-up pennies

92
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:27,260
再用它买张彩票 铁定能中
and bought a ticket with them, we couldn't lose.

93
00:03:27,290 --> 00:03:30,150
但现在我找到了好老公
But now I have a wonderful husband,

94
00:03:30,150 --> 00:03:31,510
有了好归宿
a beautiful home...

95
00:03:31,550 --> 00:03:34,621
我觉得自己已经中大奖了
I feel like I already won the lottery.

96
00:03:34,651 --> 00:03:36,121
所以万一中奖 能全部归我吗
So I can keep whatever we win?

97
00:03:36,151 --> 00:03:39,391
想得美 大部分硬币都是我捡的
I think no. I found most of them.

98
00:03:42,151 --> 00:03:43,951
能把这个放到存钱罐里吗
Can you put this in the jar with the others?

99
00:03:44,001 --> 00:03:44,751
没问题
Si.

100
00:03:45,671 --> 00:03:46,941
啊 我忘了
Ay. I forgot.

101
00:03:46,971 --> 00:03:48,611
你保险箱的密码是什么来着
What is the combination to your safe?

102
00:03:50,141 --> 00:03:51,541
我还是跟你一起去吧
I'll just come with you.

103
00:03:51,581 --> 00:03:53,211
噢 真有意思 难道我们家的情况是
Oh, yes, 'cause that's how this arrangement works--

104
00:03:53,241 --> 00:03:54,561
靠你们俩来养活我吗
I take money from you!

105
00:03:57,971 --> 00:03:59,131
你好
Hello?

106
00:03:59,171 --> 00:04:01,501
玛戈啊 不 她刚上楼去了
Oh, hi, Margo. No, she just ran upstairs.

107
00:04:01,551 --> 00:04:03,651
听着 那些剧院的票啊
Listen, about these theater tickets--

108
00:04:03,691 --> 00:04:05,322
你不用费那么大劲去
Don't knock yourself out trying to...

109
00:04:05,362 --> 00:04:07,022
已经搞到了
Oh, you did?

110
00:04:07,042 --> 00:04:08,592
那个 抱歉现在才通知你
Well, sorry to do this last minute,

111
00:04:08,632 --> 00:04:10,222
可他们去不了了
but they can't go.

112
00:04:10,222 --> 00:04:12,322
不 曼尼有个橄榄球比赛 所以
No, Manny has a football game, so...

113
00:04:12,322 --> 00:04:15,172
杰 能帮我把茶泡上吗
Jay, could you steep my tea?

114
00:04:16,912 --> 00:04:20,782
再多的话也不足以说明 那孩子多么需要踢橄榄球
I cannot express to you enough how much this kid needs football.

115
00:04:20,782 --> 00:04:23,832
整幢房子的参观结束
And that is the whole house...

116
00:04:23,832 --> 00:04:25,272
再一次的
Again.

117
00:04:25,302 --> 00:04:27,742
我喜欢这房子 可不是那种喜欢
I love it, but I just don't love it.

118
00:04:27,772 --> 00:04:28,302
你喜欢吗
Do you love it?

119
00:04:28,302 --> 00:04:29,782
当然 我当然喜欢
I love it. I absolutely love it.

120
00:04:29,782 --> 00:04:31,942
我就是不太确定是不是爱上它了
I'm just not sure if I'm in love with it.

121
00:04:31,982 --> 00:04:33,082
我懂的
Oh, yeah.

122
00:04:33,112 --> 00:04:34,603
我们公司有个说法
We have an expression around the office

123
00:04:34,633 --> 00:04:36,723
把那些做不成的买卖叫做
for when a sale just isn't happening--

124
00:04:37,043 --> 00:04:39,623
佣金无望
"Commission: Impossible."

125
00:04:39,983 --> 00:04:41,703
那是对他们来说
Maybe for some people.

126
00:04:41,743 --> 00:04:43,523
我忘了之前有没有提过
Not sure if I mentioned it before,

127
00:04:43,553 --> 00:04:45,793
这房子可是附带有
but the house does come with a hookup

128
00:04:45,823 --> 00:04:47,493
一台欧式洗衣机的
for a European washing machine.

129
00:04:47,523 --> 00:04:49,153
这个我喜欢
Oh, I love that.

130
00:04:50,933 --> 00:04:53,153
真抱歉
Oh, so sorry.

131
00:04:53,763 --> 00:04:55,183
"老大"来电
It's the boss.

132
00:04:57,093 --> 00:04:58,393
嗨 我在回家路上呢
Hi. I'm on my way home.

133
00:04:58,423 --> 00:05:00,193
刚给海莉打电话 一直没人接
I've been calling Haley, but nobody's answering.

134
00:05:00,223 --> 00:05:01,193
都还好吧
Is everything okay there?

135
00:05:01,233 --> 00:05:03,293
一切都好
Everything here is great.

136
00:05:03,333 --> 00:05:05,474
那太好了 你把椅子搬出去了没
Oh, thank god. Did you put the chair out front?

137
00:05:05,474 --> 00:05:06,644
还没呢
Not yet.

138
00:05:06,684 --> 00:05:08,284
亲爱的 一会赶不上垃圾车收垃圾了
Honey, you're gonna miss the trash pickup.

139
00:05:08,294 --> 00:05:09,794
别担心 就算他们不要 别人也会要的
Don't worry. If they don't take it, someone else will.

140
00:05:09,854 --> 00:05:10,764
谁没事会从我们草坪上
Who is gonna pick up

141
00:05:10,804 --> 00:05:12,384
把那破椅子搬走啊
that ratty chair off our lawn?

142
00:05:12,404 --> 00:05:14,284
开什么玩笑 它好着呢
Are you kidding? It's in great shape.

143
00:05:14,324 --> 00:05:16,554
超级舒服 人见人爱花见花开
Super cozy. People are always commenting on it.

144
00:05:16,594 --> 00:05:19,204
相信我 今晚前就会有人要的
Trust me, it'll be gone by the end of the day.

145
00:05:19,204 --> 00:05:20,474
拜托 现在就扔掉
Please, just do it now.

146
00:05:20,474 --> 00:05:21,524
我没办法
I can't.

147
00:05:21,564 --> 00:05:22,814
太抱歉了
I'm so sorry.

148
00:05:22,824 --> 00:05:23,824
等我这儿客户走了
when I'm done with these clients,

149
00:05:23,864 --> 00:05:25,314
我会给卢克和利昂打电话
I'll call Luke and Leon.

150
00:05:25,344 --> 00:05:27,014
我肯定会说服他们的
I know I can talk them into it.

151
00:05:27,044 --> 00:05:28,904
我们可不能把这房子让给卢克和利昂
We are not losing this house to Luke and Leon.

152
00:05:28,934 --> 00:05:30,764
你说给他俩打电话是什么意思
What do you mean, "Call luke and leon"?

153
00:05:30,824 --> 00:05:31,754
你不在家的吗
Aren't you at home?

154
00:05:31,784 --> 00:05:33,874
不在 你走之前我就走了
No, I left right before you did.

155
00:05:33,874 --> 00:05:36,575
菲尔 我们家 那些娃
Phil, the house... The--the kids...

156
00:05:36,575 --> 00:05:37,985
天呐 那松鼠
Oh, god, the squirrel.

157
00:05:38,495 --> 00:05:40,325
喂
Hello?

158
00:05:41,375 --> 00:05:42,865
我们要了
We'll take it.

159
00:05:44,465 --> 00:05:46,135
佣金
Commission...

160
00:05:46,165 --> 00:05:47,935
到手
Accomplished.

161
00:05:49,685 --> 00:05:51,805
你现在的生活多美好啊
So how great is your life right now, huh?

162
00:05:51,835 --> 00:05:54,145
新房子 新宝宝
A new house, a new baby,

163
00:05:54,175 --> 00:05:56,205
斯特凡的止秃药也开始起效了
Stefan's propecia's kicking in.

164
00:05:57,805 --> 00:05:59,485
是他的短信 他在路上了
That's him. He's on his way.

165
00:05:59,515 --> 00:06:00,835
他短信里写的"路上"
He texted "O.M.W."

166
00:06:00,875 --> 00:06:01,805
我们带着孩子开车的时候
We try to keep our texts short

167
00:06:01,835 --> 00:06:02,935
总是尽量保持短信简洁
when we're driving with the baby.

168
00:06:02,975 --> 00:06:05,296
哇噻 你俩真是好家长
Oh, well, what wonderful parents you are.

169
00:06:05,296 --> 00:06:07,796
你们一定有点嫉恨我们吧
You guys hate us a little bit, don't you?

170
00:06:07,826 --> 00:06:09,726
-没 哪会啊 -有那么点
- No. God, no. - Just a little.

171
00:06:09,786 --> 00:06:11,136
你们考虑过代孕吗
Have you thought about surrogacy?

172
00:06:11,136 --> 00:06:12,526
自己造个婴儿
At least you'd be making a baby

173
00:06:12,526 --> 00:06:14,176
至少要比等着哪个孕妇
instead of waiting around for some pregnant mom

174
00:06:14,176 --> 00:06:15,306
来选你们要好些
to maybe pick you.

175
00:06:15,346 --> 00:06:16,496
我们倒是考虑过
Well, we considered it,

176
00:06:16,496 --> 00:06:18,806
可是我们不知道怎么决定谁来... 莉莉呢
But how do you decide which one will--where's Lily?

177
00:06:18,806 --> 00:06:20,436
-睡觉呢 -给"蛋糕"上"糖霜"[受孕]
- Sleeping. - Ice the cupcake.

178
00:06:20,466 --> 00:06:22,066
这有什么不能在莉莉面前说的
That you couldn't say in front of Lily?

179
00:06:22,106 --> 00:06:24,076
听到这话她就会想要吃蛋糕
Well, then, she'd want a cupcake. Yeah, well...

180
00:06:24,106 --> 00:06:25,706
混捐的好处就在这
But that's the beauty of the swirl.

181
00:06:25,746 --> 00:06:26,706
混捐
The swirl?

182
00:06:26,726 --> 00:06:28,556
夫夫二人同时捐精 然后混在一起
You both donate, they mix it up,

183
00:06:28,556 --> 00:06:29,566
让卵细胞受精
Fertilize the egg.

184
00:06:29,606 --> 00:06:31,426
谁都不知道亲爹是谁
You never know who the father is.

185
00:06:32,806 --> 00:06:34,736
斯特凡来了
Ooh. That's Stefan.

186
00:06:35,887 --> 00:06:37,957
我们是不是该考虑下混捐
Yeah, maybe we should think about this swirl.

187
00:06:37,957 --> 00:06:39,937
那个 我觉得代孕不适合我俩
Well, I-I didn't think surrogacy was for us.

188
00:06:39,987 --> 00:06:41,727
总有一个人 会有种被排挤在外的感觉
But, you know, 'cause one of us would feel left out.

189
00:06:41,737 --> 00:06:43,737
可是如果不知道谁是亲爹的话
Yeah, but if you don't know whose it is...

190
00:06:43,777 --> 00:06:45,277
抱歉我们迟到了
Sorry we're late.

191
00:06:45,277 --> 00:06:48,417
同志们 来认识一下罗可
Guys, meet Roco.

192
00:06:48,417 --> 00:06:51,257
罗可还是可可啊[茶色]
Roco or Cocoa?

193
00:06:53,717 --> 00:06:54,687
看他在球场上
Look at him out there.

194
00:06:54,717 --> 00:06:56,857
太刺激了
Oh, ay. This is so exciting.

195
00:07:00,607 --> 00:07:01,897
加油冲啊 漂亮
Go ahead! Attaboy!

196
00:07:01,957 --> 00:07:04,067
-冲啊 往前冲 -跑啊曼尼 跑啊
- Go! Go ahead! Attaboy! - Go, Manny! Run!

197
00:07:04,097 --> 00:07:07,298
我知道歌洛莉亚会发现我向她撒谎了
I knew Gloria would find out I lied about those tickets.

198
00:07:07,338 --> 00:07:09,268
可是我觉得 等她看见曼尼在球场上
But I figured when she saw Manny out there,

199
00:07:09,288 --> 00:07:11,038
跟其他孩子开开心心地玩
playing with all those other kids,

200
00:07:11,068 --> 00:07:13,508
她会感谢我的
she'd thank me.

201
00:07:13,538 --> 00:07:15,238
那是我想象中的美事
That's what I figured.

202
00:07:15,278 --> 00:07:16,238
快跑 快跑
Go! Go!

203
00:07:16,278 --> 00:07:17,518
他干嘛呢这是
What the hell's he doing?

204
00:07:17,518 --> 00:07:19,208
跑啊曼尼 跑啊
Run, Manny! Run!

205
00:07:19,208 --> 00:07:20,868
妈妈 第100个硬币
Mom! Number 100!

206
00:07:20,868 --> 00:07:22,718
我们现在运气足够了
Now we have the lucky--oh!

207
00:07:35,108 --> 00:07:36,059
谢天谢地
Oh, thank god.

208
00:07:36,099 --> 00:07:37,049
没人死掉
Nobody's dead.

209
00:07:37,079 --> 00:07:39,429
也可能 我们都死了
Or... We're all dead.

210
00:07:39,849 --> 00:07:41,099
损失了多少盘子
How many plates did we lose?

211
00:07:41,119 --> 00:07:43,299
一个都没坏 卢克和海莉用饼干烤盘
None. Luke and Haley used cookie sheets

212
00:07:43,299 --> 00:07:44,729
在一地玻璃弹中给我清理了一条路出来
to clear a path through the marbles for me.

213
00:07:44,769 --> 00:07:45,699
玻璃弹呢
Where are the marbles?

214
00:07:45,729 --> 00:07:47,149
在这呢
Right here.

215
00:07:47,149 --> 00:07:47,719
海莉
Oh, Haley!

216
00:07:47,719 --> 00:07:50,109
我在里面灌了胶水 以后不会再倒出来了
I put glue on them so it doesn't happen again.

217
00:07:50,109 --> 00:07:51,179
椅子呢
What about the chair?

218
00:07:51,219 --> 00:07:53,249
利昂和我用滑板把它推到外边去了
Leon and I rolled it outside on some skateboards.

219
00:07:54,749 --> 00:07:55,839
松鼠呢
The squirrel?

220
00:07:55,889 --> 00:07:58,339
你觉得我会允许那种荒唐事发生吗
You think I was going to let that happen?

221
00:07:59,809 --> 00:08:01,269
那些孩子离开父母也会活得好好的
These kids are going to survive.

222
00:08:01,269 --> 00:08:03,989
他们集我和菲尔的优点于一身
They are the best of me and Phil.

223
00:08:03,989 --> 00:08:07,160
卢克利用了滑板 海莉把弹珠全粘起来
Luke using the skateboards, Haley gluing the marbles--

224
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:08,860
完全遗传了菲尔
That is pure Phil.

225
00:08:08,900 --> 00:08:11,100
艾丽克斯让一切保持井然有序
Alex keeping everyone in line--

226
00:08:11,130 --> 00:08:12,290
完全遗传了我
Pure me.

227
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:17,700
有时候我真担心会没人喜欢艾丽克斯
Sometimes I worry no one's gonna like Alex.

228
00:08:21,210 --> 00:08:22,170
好了 小老弟
There you go, buddy.

229
00:08:22,210 --> 00:08:23,090
谢谢
Thank you.

230
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:26,900
怎么了 需要什么东西 我给你拿
What? You need anything? I'll get it.

231
00:08:26,930 --> 00:08:28,770
牛排酱 不过没关系
Steak sauce, but it's okay.

232
00:08:28,790 --> 00:08:30,640
我活动活动可能更好
It's probably good for me to move around.

233
00:08:34,930 --> 00:08:38,081
杰 看见你这么照顾他可真温馨
Oh, Jay, it's so nice to see you take care of him like that.

234
00:08:38,111 --> 00:08:39,831
这有什么好惊讶的 他是我们儿子
Why are you surprised? He's our kid.

235
00:08:39,881 --> 00:08:42,111
我们家的人就是要互相照顾
We take care of each other in this family.

236
00:08:42,801 --> 00:08:44,941
我想灭了你
I want to kill you.

237
00:08:44,941 --> 00:08:46,811
让我猜猜 玛戈告的密
Wild guess--Margo?

238
00:08:46,811 --> 00:08:47,921
听我解释
Let me explain.

239
00:08:47,921 --> 00:08:50,041
你别找借口
There is no excuse.

240
00:08:50,091 --> 00:08:52,591
父母间的私人恩怨 我还是回避为好
This is something private. I'm gonna get outta here.

241
00:08:52,621 --> 00:08:54,691
所以你才表现得那么好
So that's why you were being so nice.

242
00:08:54,731 --> 00:08:55,961
你骗我的朋友
You lied to my friend...

243
00:08:55,991 --> 00:08:58,231
你让曼尼去踢橄榄球
you made Manny play the american football...

244
00:08:58,261 --> 00:09:01,281
他被人撞成这样都是你害的
it is your fault that he got estamped.

245
00:09:01,841 --> 00:09:03,391
该说是你的错吧
Or is it your fault?

246
00:09:03,391 --> 00:09:05,731
他停下来去捡一枚硬币 真让人大跌眼镜
He stopped to pick up a penny, for god sake.

247
00:09:05,731 --> 00:09:07,452
小心说话 杰
Be careful what you say, Jay.

248
00:09:07,452 --> 00:09:10,302
你现在的状态岌岌可危
You're skating on thin eggshells right now.

249
00:09:10,302 --> 00:09:11,742
我只是想让他走出家门
I tried to get him out there

250
00:09:11,742 --> 00:09:12,912
和他同龄人一起玩
With kids his own age...

251
00:09:12,942 --> 00:09:14,282
他这个年纪就该如此
Which is what he should be doing...

252
00:09:14,302 --> 00:09:16,362
而不是一下午都陪在他妈咪身旁
And not spending another afternoon with his mommy.

253
00:09:16,362 --> 00:09:18,412
你要是对曼尼的教育方法有意见
If you have a problem with the way manny's being raised,

254
00:09:18,412 --> 00:09:19,792
你就跟我明说
You talk to me!

255
00:09:19,792 --> 00:09:21,672
-我不正在说嘛 -我不想听
- I am. - I don't wanna hear it!

256
00:09:28,872 --> 00:09:30,212
菲尔 你真的用不着这样
Phil, you really didn't have to do this.

257
00:09:30,212 --> 00:09:32,332
我今天能卖掉那房子多亏了你们
I sold a house today because of you two.

258
00:09:32,332 --> 00:09:33,902
请你们吃顿饭是最起码的了
The least I can do is buy you dinner.

259
00:09:33,902 --> 00:09:35,582
我看过那房子 漂亮极了
I saw that house. It is gorgeous.

260
00:09:35,622 --> 00:09:37,123
-我知道 -我们真为他们高兴
- I know. - We're real happy for them.

261
00:09:37,153 --> 00:09:38,723
他们给我看了他们家孩子的照片
They showed me a picture of the baby.

262
00:09:38,723 --> 00:09:39,863
那小家伙多萌啊
How adorable is that little guy?

263
00:09:39,913 --> 00:09:42,203
是的 我们真为他们高兴
Yes, we're real happy for them.

264
00:09:42,203 --> 00:09:44,273
行了 你该悠着点喝了
Okay, you might wanna slow down there.

265
00:09:45,203 --> 00:09:46,113
怎么了 我在玩一种新型酒桌游戏
What? I'm playing a new drinking game.

266
00:09:46,113 --> 00:09:48,573
叫做 "郁闷在心头 美酒喝进口"
It's called "Every time I'm depressed, I take a drink."

267
00:09:48,573 --> 00:09:49,793
还真有那种游戏
That game exists.

268
00:09:49,833 --> 00:09:51,613
叫做酗酒
It's called alcoholism.

269
00:09:52,273 --> 00:09:53,773
抱歉 你说得对
Oh, I'm sorry, you're right. I'm...

270
00:09:53,773 --> 00:09:56,003
我在自我沉沦 那一点都不好
I'm wallowing, and it's not cute.

271
00:09:56,043 --> 00:09:57,043
敬高兴点的事
To happier things.

272
00:09:57,073 --> 00:09:58,203
没错 敬高兴点的事
Yes. To happier things.

273
00:09:58,223 --> 00:09:59,913
-高兴点的事 -对 -举杯
- Happier things, - Yes. - There you go.

274
00:10:00,423 --> 00:10:02,853
我还记得喝前几杯时的事
I remember the first few drinks...

275
00:10:02,893 --> 00:10:06,563
但是后来嘛 就只有支离破碎的记忆了
And, um, after that, the night's just bits and pieces.

276
00:10:06,623 --> 00:10:08,614
我要干一件我以前从没干过的事
I wanna do something I never do--

277
00:10:08,644 --> 00:10:10,364
显摆我家的孩子们
Brag about my kids.

278
00:10:10,394 --> 00:10:12,644
今天 他们又聪明
Today, they were resourceful,

279
00:10:12,704 --> 00:10:15,084
又有责任感 他们
They were responsible, they...

280
00:10:15,164 --> 00:10:16,674
降价四成
Put 40% down.

281
00:10:16,704 --> 00:10:18,334
带他们看5次房其实也是值得的
It was worth showing the house five times

282
00:10:18,354 --> 00:10:19,434
等待着...
And waiting...

283
00:10:19,474 --> 00:10:21,154
一年的等待
Almost a year.

284
00:10:21,204 --> 00:10:23,314
开什么玩笑 谁他妈要...
Seriously! Who do you have to...

285
00:10:23,344 --> 00:10:24,714
吹 那真的挺烫的
Blow. That's really hot.

286
00:10:24,724 --> 00:10:26,544
你为什么不把它凉一凉 尝点这个
Why don't you let it cool down? Try some of the...

287
00:10:26,584 --> 00:10:27,894
墨西哥裔
Mexican!

288
00:10:27,934 --> 00:10:29,884
那孩子明显是墨西哥种
The baby is clearly mexican!

289
00:10:29,884 --> 00:10:31,184
所以 混捐不行 完全是自欺欺人
So, you know, the swirl is out.

290
00:10:31,184 --> 00:10:34,124
那简直让人想...
Ugh. It's enough to make you lose...

291
00:10:34,154 --> 00:10:35,124
我想想
Track.

292
00:10:35,154 --> 00:10:37,094
这是我第4杯吗
Is this my fourth drink?

293
00:10:37,124 --> 00:10:38,345
是我第4杯
It's my fourth.

294
00:10:38,395 --> 00:10:40,475
我是不是说了两遍第4杯
I said "Four" Twice, didn't I?

295
00:10:40,515 --> 00:10:41,785
我说了 是不是
I did, didn't I?

296
00:10:41,835 --> 00:10:44,415
我想我们得需要四辆出租
I think we're gonna need four cabs...

297
00:10:44,455 --> 00:10:47,315
-两辆 - 两辆 都是你害我的
- Two! - Two! You made me!

298
00:10:48,165 --> 00:10:51,905
我 我貌似记得 有人还哭了
I-I vaguely remember... Someone crying?

299
00:10:51,935 --> 00:10:52,965
如果我们找代孕妈妈
If we ever did surrogacy,

300
00:10:52,965 --> 00:10:54,355
我想让你来捐精
I would want you to be the donor.

301
00:10:54,385 --> 00:10:56,235
你那么聪明 还那么帅
You're so smart, you're so handsome.

302
00:10:56,275 --> 00:10:57,825
别说了 应该是你捐啦
Oh, stop it! It should be you!

303
00:10:57,855 --> 00:11:00,845
-你那么风趣又有才华 -好了啦
- You're so fun! You're so talented! - Okay.

304
00:11:00,895 --> 00:11:03,725
真不公平啊 我好爱你们夫夫啊
It's not fair. I love you both so much.

305
00:11:04,855 --> 00:11:05,965
如果你们要小孩
If you could have a baby

306
00:11:05,965 --> 00:11:07,315
如果他是你们俩的结合
that was a mix of the two of you,

307
00:11:07,315 --> 00:11:09,036
我会非常爱那个宝宝的
I would love that baby so much.

308
00:11:09,086 --> 00:11:11,136
你嘴真甜
That is so sweet.

309
00:11:11,166 --> 00:11:14,056
-我是说真的 -你真好
- I meant it. - That is so sweet.

310
00:11:14,726 --> 00:11:17,096
天啊 伙计们 我们可以这么干
Oh, my god. You guys, we could do this.

311
00:11:17,096 --> 00:11:18,276
我们可以的
We could do this.

312
00:11:18,316 --> 00:11:19,996
我们可以生一个
We could make a baby

313
00:11:20,036 --> 00:11:22,926
融合塔克家和普里契特家血统的孩子
that is half Tucker and half Pritchett.

314
00:11:23,396 --> 00:11:25,346
你说的和我想的是一个意思吗
Are you saying what I think you're saying?

315
00:11:25,376 --> 00:11:26,346
是
Yeah.

316
00:11:26,376 --> 00:11:27,946
克隆吗
Cloning?

317
00:11:27,976 --> 00:11:29,356
不是 不是
No. No.

318
00:11:29,356 --> 00:11:30,896
我是说
I'm saying...

319
00:11:30,906 --> 00:11:32,076
我捐出卵子
I give the egg.

320
00:11:32,126 --> 00:11:33,626
是的
Yeah.

321
00:11:33,666 --> 00:11:35,346
我捐卵子 这不就有普里契特血统了吗
I give the egg. That's the Pritchett side.

322
00:11:35,386 --> 00:11:38,447
然后小卡 你就捐出精子 对不
And then, Cam, you're the father, right?

323
00:11:38,487 --> 00:11:40,417
然后 就 融合一下
And then we just, like, mix it

324
00:11:40,467 --> 00:11:43,337
然后就把它放进代孕妈妈的肚子里
And put it in a, like, a surrogate lady thing,

325
00:11:43,377 --> 00:11:46,007
然后砰 宝宝就有了
And then bang! We have a baby.

326
00:11:46,377 --> 00:11:48,247
你是认真的吗
Oh. Are--are you serious?

327
00:11:48,277 --> 00:11:49,477
你愿意那么做吗
You would do that?

328
00:11:49,507 --> 00:11:51,067
我会甚感荣幸的
I would be honored.

329
00:11:51,097 --> 00:11:55,117
二位 如果说我今天学到了什么的话
You guys, you guys, if there's one thing I have learned today,

330
00:11:55,147 --> 00:11:57,587
那就是看着你们的宝宝
It's the pleasure of looking at your children,

331
00:11:57,617 --> 00:12:00,567
然后从他身上看见你们俩的影子
And seeing both-- both of you in there.

332
00:12:00,637 --> 00:12:02,957
而且我愿意让你们经历这种事情
And I want you to have that experience.

333
00:12:02,987 --> 00:12:04,957
是的 我们期盼已久
Yeah. We want that.

334
00:12:04,997 --> 00:12:06,627
还有更好的呢
And something else...

335
00:12:06,667 --> 00:12:09,348
伙计们 我生的娃超棒的
guys, I make really good babies.

336
00:12:09,398 --> 00:12:11,768
-是 -我好像有什么魔法卵子什么的
- Yes. - I have, like, magic eggs or something.

337
00:12:11,788 --> 00:12:12,998
-是 -真是金牌卵子啊
- Yes! - They're golden.

338
00:12:13,038 --> 00:12:15,038
天啊 菲尔啊
Oh, gosh. Oh, Phil,

339
00:12:15,068 --> 00:12:17,068
我真 我真不知道该说什么好了
I don't--what do-- what do you say about this?

340
00:12:17,108 --> 00:12:18,788
我觉得孩子将会是我们大家的
I think we're all having a baby!

341
00:12:18,828 --> 00:12:20,278
来个桌抱
Aah! Table hug!

342
00:12:23,008 --> 00:12:26,098
亲娘的七舅老爷啊
Sweet potato fries!

343
00:12:30,128 --> 00:12:32,128
-我都干了什么啊 -我知道
- What have I done? - I know.

344
00:12:36,348 --> 00:12:37,578
我当时想什么呢啊
What was I thinking?

345
00:12:37,608 --> 00:12:40,129
我 我 我喝醉了然后就要生个娃了
I-I-I just get drunk and I bring a baby into the world?

346
00:12:40,129 --> 00:12:42,429
那你就会生第4个孩子 我们4个人的孩子
That would be 4 for 4.

347
00:12:42,429 --> 00:12:43,699
我绝对不能那样
I can't go through with it.

348
00:12:43,699 --> 00:12:46,269
别慌 你还啥都没捐呢
Don't panic. You haven't donated anything yet.

349
00:12:46,269 --> 00:12:48,769
况且 你的卵子还有活力吗
Besides, what are the chances your eggs even work?

350
00:12:48,769 --> 00:12:50,869
或者我们干脆不承认说过那些
What are the chances we can pretend I never said that?

351
00:12:50,899 --> 00:12:53,359
那太诡异了 那是我弟弟啊
It's weird. It's my brother.

352
00:12:53,359 --> 00:12:55,209
然后就会有一个小孩出生
And then there would be this baby over there

353
00:12:55,239 --> 00:12:56,989
是我的卵子发育的 却又不是我生出来的
That's my baby, but it's not my baby...

354
00:12:57,009 --> 00:12:58,629
听着不错 你就这么说就行
That actually sounds good. Just say that.

355
00:12:58,629 --> 00:13:01,269
再过两小时 我们去你爸家吃早午餐就会看见他了
We're gonna see him for brunch in two hours over at your dad's

356
00:13:01,269 --> 00:13:03,769
那好像有点 太早[快]了吧
Ooh. That seems... Soon

357
00:13:03,799 --> 00:13:05,589
而且很难面对
And--and hard.

358
00:13:06,599 --> 00:13:09,540
如果我拿你当挡箭牌怎么样
What if... What if I blame it on you?

359
00:13:09,540 --> 00:13:12,460
如果我说是你不同意行不
What if we say that you're not okay with it?

360
00:13:12,460 --> 00:13:13,630
-不行 -为什么
- No! - Why?

361
00:13:13,630 --> 00:13:16,500
你真不介意另一个男人给你妻子的卵子受精吗
Are you really okay with another man fertilizing your wife's egg?

362
00:13:16,500 --> 00:13:18,330
-当然介意 听着都恶心 -就是
- Of course not! That's creepy. - Yes.

363
00:13:18,330 --> 00:13:21,260
况且 万一你和小卡生出了更优质的孩子
Plus, what if you and Cam make a better baby than we did?

364
00:13:21,260 --> 00:13:24,740
不会发生的 菲尔说了"不"
It's settled. Phil says "No."

365
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:27,160
你以为他们会相信 你顺从了我的否决吗
Like they're really gonna believe that I overruled you?

366
00:13:27,190 --> 00:13:28,340
-也是 -对吧
- Right. - Come on.

367
00:13:29,460 --> 00:13:30,690
他们会心碎的
They're gonna be crushed.

368
00:13:30,730 --> 00:13:33,630
他们盼个孩子盼了好久
They've waited so long for this baby.

369
00:13:33,630 --> 00:13:35,830
也许他们现在也想反悔了呢
Maybe they're having second thoughts, too.

370
00:13:37,230 --> 00:13:39,991
看看 这是我和克莱尔的宝宝的样子
Look--this is what my baby with Claire would look like.

371
00:13:40,021 --> 00:13:41,471
这是什么玩意儿
What is this? What...

372
00:13:41,491 --> 00:13:44,941
我找到一个网站 父母可以上传自己的照片
Okay, well, I found a web site where couples can upload pictures...

373
00:13:44,971 --> 00:13:47,281
然后它能合成宝宝的照片
and then it shows them what their baby would look like.

374
00:13:48,171 --> 00:13:50,801
这是歌洛莉亚和我的孩子
This is... Gloria and I.

375
00:13:50,841 --> 00:13:52,501
无法抗拒吧
Couldn't resist.

376
00:13:52,541 --> 00:13:55,171
天呐 简直是曼尼的翻版嘛
Wow. That-- that looks exactly like Manny.

377
00:13:55,201 --> 00:13:57,651
简直是像得诡异
Like--like weirdly so.

378
00:13:57,651 --> 00:13:58,801
另一张是什么
What--what's this other picture?

379
00:13:58,801 --> 00:14:00,681
别吃醋
Don't be jealous.

380
00:14:00,681 --> 00:14:02,481
这张
But this...

381
00:14:02,511 --> 00:14:04,781
是我和贾斯汀·汀布莱克的孩子
is me and Justin Timberlake.

382
00:14:06,351 --> 00:14:07,621
小卡 我们有个问题
Cam, we have a problem.

383
00:14:07,621 --> 00:14:09,452
怎么了 你能天天念叨瑞恩·高斯林
Oh, what? You can talk about Ryan Gosling all day,

384
00:14:09,492 --> 00:14:10,792
-而我刚说一两句 -不不不
- but the moment I say something-- - No, no, no,

385
00:14:10,792 --> 00:14:13,642
关于这个孩子 我
About this baby. I...

386
00:14:13,642 --> 00:14:15,282
我觉得我不能接受这样做
I don't think I can do it.

387
00:14:15,312 --> 00:14:17,612
什么 为什么 这样很棒
What--why? Why--it's perfect!

388
00:14:17,652 --> 00:14:20,252
我们能有个同时拥有我们两个人基因的孩子
It's our chance to have a baby that's part me, part you!

389
00:14:20,282 --> 00:14:22,322
不不 是你和克莱尔的基因
No, no! It's part you and part Claire.

390
00:14:22,352 --> 00:14:23,552
没我的份儿
I'm nowhere in there.

391
00:14:23,592 --> 00:14:24,822
而且我不能忽略的事实是
And it's not like I can pretend.

392
00:14:24,852 --> 00:14:27,092
她不是什么陌生的卵子捐赠者
It's--she's not some egg donor that we don't know.

393
00:14:27,122 --> 00:14:28,152
她是克莱尔
It's Claire.

394
00:14:28,882 --> 00:14:29,962
我们抬头不见低头见的
You know, we see her all the time.

395
00:14:29,992 --> 00:14:31,822
我们以后要怎么告诉那个孩子
And what are we supposed to tell the baby?

396
00:14:31,822 --> 00:14:33,822
向你的姑"妈"问好
"Say hi to your aunt mommy!"

397
00:14:33,852 --> 00:14:36,122
-多可爱 -不 一点儿也不可爱
- Adorable. - No, not adorable.

398
00:14:36,162 --> 00:14:37,632
绝对不行
Appalachian.

399
00:14:38,462 --> 00:14:40,583
对不起 小卡
Okay, I'm--I'm sorry, Cam.

400
00:14:43,303 --> 00:14:45,873
杰说我太黏着曼尼了
Jay says that I'm smothering Manny...

401
00:14:45,903 --> 00:14:48,043
但我只是太喜欢他了
But I'm just enjoying him.

402
00:14:48,073 --> 00:14:50,943
我是说 他们还能孩子多久呢
I mean, they're only gonna be boys for a short time.

403
00:14:50,973 --> 00:14:54,013
这房子里最棒的经历
Best time ever in this house!

404
00:14:54,043 --> 00:14:55,243
菲尔 我不太喜欢这样
I'm uncomfortable with this, Phil.

405
00:14:55,243 --> 00:14:57,483
使用手册上特意指出"禁止推拉"
The manual specifically says "No towing."

406
00:14:57,483 --> 00:14:59,263
这个世界上有两种人
There are two types of people in this world--

407
00:14:59,303 --> 00:15:00,923
一种喜欢遵循使用手册
people who follow the manual,

408
00:15:00,923 --> 00:15:02,703
另一种则喜欢亲自动手操作
and people who stick it to the manual.

409
00:15:02,723 --> 00:15:04,073
你 被"伤"了
You... are hurt.

410
00:15:06,103 --> 00:15:07,413
曼尼 发生什么了
Manny, what happened?

411
00:15:07,443 --> 00:15:08,413
橄榄球伤
Football injury.

412
00:15:08,443 --> 00:15:10,734
我妈会嚷嚷着告诉你的
My mom will yell you all about it.

413
00:15:10,734 --> 00:15:12,654
你好 莉莉
Hola, Lily!

414
00:15:12,684 --> 00:15:15,854
我亲爱的小公主想吃小饼干吗
Does my little princess want a cookie?

415
00:15:15,894 --> 00:15:17,024
就一小块吧
Oh, well, you know, maybe just one.

416
00:15:17,054 --> 00:15:18,794
她今天糖分摄入已经达到上限了
She's already had her sugar limit for today.

417
00:15:18,824 --> 00:15:19,994
你怎么知道
How can you tell?

418
00:15:21,244 --> 00:15:23,244
好吧 莉莉
Okay, Lily.

419
00:15:24,684 --> 00:15:27,134
嘿 小两口
Hey, you two.

420
00:15:27,164 --> 00:15:28,604
孩子们都到哪儿去了
So where-- oh, where are the kids?

421
00:15:28,634 --> 00:15:30,434
海莉一会儿载他们来
Oh, Haley's driving them over separately.

422
00:15:30,474 --> 00:15:32,274
大姑娘了哟
Oh! Big girl now.

423
00:15:33,074 --> 00:15:34,174
-挺好的 -是
- That's great. - Yeah

424
00:15:34,214 --> 00:15:36,464
昨晚真开心
So that was... so fun last night.

425
00:15:36,494 --> 00:15:38,194
-相当开心 -是的 昨晚很愉快
- So fun. - Yeah, we had a great night.

426
00:15:39,714 --> 00:15:41,445
是的
Yes.

427
00:15:41,445 --> 00:15:42,645
我们要
We should--

428
00:15:42,665 --> 00:15:43,885
别说
Jinx!

429
00:15:44,365 --> 00:15:45,775
我们要走这边
Yeah, we're going this way, so...

430
00:15:45,795 --> 00:15:47,135
等会儿见
We'll see you in a bit.

431
00:15:50,485 --> 00:15:51,785
我没法开口
I cannot tell them.

432
00:15:51,825 --> 00:15:53,975
我不能伤他们的心
I cannot break their hearts.

433
00:15:54,005 --> 00:15:57,125
就因为怕尴尬 你要和小卡生孩子吗
So you're gonna have Cam's baby just to keep things from being weird?

434
00:15:57,165 --> 00:15:58,195
怎么回事
Um, what?

435
00:15:58,215 --> 00:16:00,025
你和小卡舅夫要生个孩子吗
You and Uncle Cam are having a baby?

436
00:16:00,025 --> 00:16:01,235
孩子们 小声点
Kids, shh.

437
00:16:01,265 --> 00:16:03,075
我们是讨论过关于
There was a discussion about the possibility

438
00:16:03,075 --> 00:16:04,345
让你妈妈捐赠卵子
of your mom donating an egg

439
00:16:04,345 --> 00:16:06,095
让他们能有自己的孩子这件事
so that the guys could have a baby.

440
00:16:06,095 --> 00:16:08,005
但是我们觉得这不是一个好主意
But we decided it was not a good idea.

441
00:16:08,035 --> 00:16:09,785
为什么 因为莉莉是个小怪胎吗
Why? Because Lily's such a mess?

442
00:16:09,845 --> 00:16:11,606
有很多原因
For a lot of reasons.

443
00:16:11,646 --> 00:16:15,116
-他们有 -但我们都同意她是个小祸害吧
- They have-- - But we can agree that she's a disastrous human being?

444
00:16:15,116 --> 00:16:16,896
我觉得这主意不错
I think it's a great idea.

445
00:16:16,896 --> 00:16:20,346
对 是个贴心的礼物 妈妈 很有创意
Yeah. It's a really beautiful offer, mom. I'm impressed.

446
00:16:20,396 --> 00:16:23,906
天呐 小卡 他们已经告诉孩子们了
Oh, my god. Cam, they told the kids already,

447
00:16:23,906 --> 00:16:26,046
他们看上去很期待
And they seem to be totally into it.

448
00:16:26,046 --> 00:16:27,176
好吧 难道只有我吗
All right, is it just me?

449
00:16:27,176 --> 00:16:28,626
只有我一个人觉得怪怪的吗
Am I the only one that thinks this is weird?

450
00:16:28,626 --> 00:16:29,876
或许一点都不怪
Maybe it's not weird.

451
00:16:29,876 --> 00:16:31,806
说不定我们是勇敢的先锋呢
Maybe we're pioneers.

452
00:16:31,806 --> 00:16:32,986
不 我们才不是勇敢的先锋
No, we're hardly pioneers.

453
00:16:32,986 --> 00:16:35,116
你有三个不同的吹风机 以备不同的天气下使用
You have three different hair dryers for different types of weather.

454
00:16:35,116 --> 00:16:37,496
也许你需要一些时间来接受那个想法
Maybe it's just gonna take some time to get used to the idea.

455
00:16:37,496 --> 00:16:39,156
-什么想法 -没什么
- What idea? - Oh. No.

456
00:16:39,156 --> 00:16:40,707
杰
Um, well, Jay...

457
00:16:40,737 --> 00:16:41,977
-小卡 -克莱尔已经
- Cam. - Claire has--

458
00:16:42,007 --> 00:16:43,677
不 我 我觉得
No. I-I-I just don't think

459
00:16:43,697 --> 00:16:45,607
我爸还没准备好接受那个设想 所以
my dad's really ready for this conversation. So...

460
00:16:45,627 --> 00:16:48,677
别总觉得我是个老顽固 我已经进步了
Oh, stop acting like I'm some stodgy old coot. I've grown.

461
00:16:48,697 --> 00:16:49,747
好吧
Okay.

462
00:16:49,787 --> 00:16:54,017
杰 克莱尔同意捐赠她的卵子给我们
Um, Jay, Claire has, um, offered to give us one of her eggs

463
00:16:54,057 --> 00:16:55,627
这样我们将会有个
so we can have a baby

464
00:16:55,627 --> 00:16:57,587
一半普里契特一半塔克血统的孩子
that's half Pritchett, half Tucker.

465
00:16:57,627 --> 00:17:00,177
那简直是违背自然规律 我反对
That's unnatural. I'm against it.

466
00:17:00,177 --> 00:17:04,067
大事件 大事件 杰提出反对意见了
Oh, surprise, surprise. Jay is against something.

467
00:17:04,067 --> 00:17:06,287
小卡和克莱尔想生个孩子
Cam and Claire wanna have a baby together.

468
00:17:07,557 --> 00:17:08,867
你们不能那样做
You're not gonna do that.

469
00:17:08,867 --> 00:17:10,447
那不该由你来做决定 爸爸
It's not your decision, dad.

470
00:17:10,467 --> 00:17:11,418
你根本就是欠考虑
You're not thinking straight.

471
00:17:11,418 --> 00:17:13,778
根本不该由你说了算 克莱尔和我是成年人
And you're not in charge. Okay, Claire and I are adults.

472
00:17:13,778 --> 00:17:16,798
如果我们都同意这么做 这事就算定了
If--if we want this to happen, it--it's gonna happen.

473
00:17:16,828 --> 00:17:18,308
看来想反悔也迟了
So much for second thoughts.

474
00:17:18,348 --> 00:17:20,468
小姑娘 我要和你谈谈
Young lady, I need to have a talk with you.

475
00:17:20,498 --> 00:17:23,048
-算了吧 -不行
- I don't... - No.

476
00:17:23,088 --> 00:17:25,968
你没权利对别人的生活指手画脚
You don't get to tell everyone how to live their lives,

477
00:17:26,008 --> 00:17:28,908
什么小男生不能和妈咪一起玩
that boys cannot spend time with their mommies

478
00:17:28,938 --> 00:17:31,758
姐姐和弟夫不能生孩子
or that brothers and sisters can't make babies.

479
00:17:31,798 --> 00:17:33,828
-你同意他们瞎胡闹吗 -不
- So you're all for this? - No.

480
00:17:33,848 --> 00:17:36,188
那有违天理伦常 可那是他们的事
It's a freak show, but it's their freak show.

481
00:17:37,668 --> 00:17:39,028
往事又重演了吗
So this is happening again?

482
00:17:39,028 --> 00:17:40,388
我才不会因为我爸觉得
Well, I'm not gonna not do it

483
00:17:40,388 --> 00:17:41,989
不该做 我就不去做
'cause my dad thinks I shouldn't.

484
00:17:42,019 --> 00:17:43,519
我不太明白
You know, I'm not following.

485
00:17:43,559 --> 00:17:45,319
就算真不做 那也得是我不想做
We're not doing it 'cause I don't want to do it.

486
00:17:45,319 --> 00:17:45,859
我们不去做
What we're not doing

487
00:17:45,859 --> 00:17:48,289
不能因为他不让我们做 我们才不做
is not doing it 'cause he doesn't want us to do it.

488
00:17:48,289 --> 00:17:49,889
要不要孩子一句话吧
Just say baby or no baby.

489
00:17:49,929 --> 00:17:52,869
是不是嫌我们这家人还不够亲密
Isn't it enough this family spends a lot of time together?

490
00:17:52,869 --> 00:17:54,359
现在还得搞个近亲繁殖
Now we have to inbreed.

491
00:17:54,359 --> 00:17:57,199
爸 这并不是近亲繁殖 而是...
Okay, dad, it's not technically inbreeding. It's, um...

492
00:17:57,229 --> 00:18:00,999
我得说句 我觉得我妈这样做太勇敢了
For the record, I think what my mom is doing is very brave.

493
00:18:00,999 --> 00:18:01,849
我喜欢这想法
I like it.

494
00:18:01,849 --> 00:18:04,109
我一直想要个半弟弟半表弟什么的
I've always kind of wanted a half-brother, half-cousin.

495
00:18:04,109 --> 00:18:05,589
真的吗 一直想要
Really? "Always"?

496
00:18:05,589 --> 00:18:07,319
如果你好好想想
Well, I mean, if you think about it...

497
00:18:19,350 --> 00:18:21,470
我们上次桌下会晤是什么时候
When was the last time we talked under a table?

498
00:18:21,470 --> 00:18:22,820
老爸和歌洛莉亚的婚宴上
Dad and Gloria's wedding reception.

499
00:18:22,850 --> 00:18:25,000
对哦
Oh, yeah.

500
00:18:26,570 --> 00:18:28,430
我爱你 你知道的
I love you. You know that...

501
00:18:28,430 --> 00:18:29,530
但我做不到
but I can't do this.

502
00:18:29,540 --> 00:18:30,880
我也一样做不到
No, no, neither can I!

503
00:18:30,930 --> 00:18:31,920
-是吗 -没错
- Really? - Yeah.

504
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:34,260
说真的吗 你也不愿...天啊
Are you serious? You can't--oh, god.

505
00:18:34,260 --> 00:18:35,460
真是松了口气 抱歉
I'm so relieved. I'm sorry.

506
00:18:35,490 --> 00:18:36,870
我...
I-I-I...

507
00:18:36,910 --> 00:18:39,330
真抱歉我把大家卷进一团乱麻里
I am so sorry I led us down this road.

508
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:40,690
克莱尔 不用抱歉
No, no. No, Claire, don't be. Don't be.

509
00:18:40,730 --> 00:18:43,931
其实这想法既无私又周到 典型的你
It was--it was generous and thoughtful, just like you.

510
00:18:43,931 --> 00:18:46,661
我真心希望自己的孩子有这些优点
How could I not want those qualities in my child?

511
00:18:48,131 --> 00:18:49,251
抱抱
Oh, come here.

512
00:18:49,651 --> 00:18:51,111
真的是要近亲繁殖了吗
So this is really happening?

513
00:18:51,111 --> 00:18:52,341
如果是又怎样 爸
Ah. What if it is, dad?

514
00:18:52,341 --> 00:18:53,561
就是 我们这是姐弟情深
Yeah. What if we love each other,

515
00:18:53,561 --> 00:18:54,361
很感人的好吧
and this is a beautiful thing?

516
00:18:54,361 --> 00:18:56,481
-这是我们的决定 不关你事 -就是
- Okay, it's our decision. It's not yours. - Yeah.

517
00:18:56,481 --> 00:18:58,781
要不要孩子一句话
So baby? No baby?

518
00:18:59,751 --> 00:19:02,401
不要
No.

519
00:19:05,511 --> 00:19:06,051
你没事吧
You okay?

520
00:19:06,051 --> 00:19:07,171
我很好
Oh, yeah. I'm fine.

521
00:19:07,221 --> 00:19:08,841
我知道你心里不舒服
Mm, I know it's been hard on you.

522
00:19:09,701 --> 00:19:11,281
不如我俩今晚出去吃顿大餐吧
Hey, what if we went out for a nice dinner tonight?

523
00:19:11,331 --> 00:19:12,702
挺好 那我打电话叫临时保姆
Oh, that'd be fun. Should I call the sitter?

524
00:19:12,732 --> 00:19:14,132
知道我今天心里的人选吗
Yeah. Oh, you know what I was thinking today?

525
00:19:14,172 --> 00:19:15,302
卢克怎么样
What about Luke?

526
00:19:15,342 --> 00:19:16,502
他俩可要好了
Oh, he's so good with her,

527
00:19:16,542 --> 00:19:18,172
瞧见他望她的眼神没
the way he looks at her...

528
00:19:18,722 --> 00:19:20,012
天呐 小卡
My god, Cam.

529
00:19:20,022 --> 00:19:22,292
瞧 她在整理自己的东西
Oh, look, she's organizing her things.

530
00:19:22,292 --> 00:19:24,722
看她穿的衣服
Look at how she's dressed.

531
00:19:26,032 --> 00:19:28,882
虽然不是亲生 但却超像咱们
We didn't make her, but she sure is us.

532
00:19:28,882 --> 00:19:31,432
莉莉宝贝 如果你把鞋子放在...
Hey, Lily, honey, it might make more sense with the shoes...

533
00:19:31,482 --> 00:19:32,982
米奇尔
Mitchell.

534
00:19:34,652 --> 00:19:36,002
她这样摆弄娃娃真有爱
I like what she did with the dolls--

535
00:19:36,042 --> 00:19:40,612
想怎么玩儿怎么玩儿
Play as you will. Play as you will.

536
00:19:41,763 --> 00:19:43,213
大枚的 记得吗
The big one, remember?

537
00:19:43,213 --> 00:19:44,683
最早发现的之一
One of the first ones we found.

538
00:19:44,713 --> 00:19:46,383
在街边的水沟里
It was at the bottom of the gutter in the street.

539
00:19:46,413 --> 00:19:47,113
是啊
Ay, yes.

540
00:19:47,113 --> 00:19:50,593
我们把香口胶黏在你的拐杖上捡到的
We put the gum at the bottom of your walking stick.

541
00:19:50,593 --> 00:19:52,513
看这个 绿色的
Ay, look at this one-- the green one,

542
00:19:52,563 --> 00:19:55,173
在我的计程车里捡到的
The one we found at the floor of my taxi.

543
00:19:55,203 --> 00:19:57,083
-你的计程车 -正是
- Your taxi? - Yes.

544
00:19:57,123 --> 00:19:59,223
在我的生活富足之前
Before I had somebody running my life for me,

545
00:19:59,253 --> 00:20:01,473
我是个夜间计程车司机
I used to drive a taxi at night.

546
00:20:01,513 --> 00:20:04,013
曼尼就睡在我旁边的座位上
Manny would sleep in the seat next to me.

547
00:20:04,043 --> 00:20:05,983
有一次 我猛踩刹车
One time, I had to hit the brakes so hard

548
00:20:06,013 --> 00:20:08,783
他一头栽了下来 发现了这枚硬币
that he fell into the floor and he found the penny.

549
00:20:08,813 --> 00:20:10,953
很幸运吧
Pretty lucky, huh?

550
00:20:10,983 --> 00:20:13,594
八年了 真不敢相信终于集齐了
Eight years. I can't believe we're finally done.

551
00:20:15,394 --> 00:20:16,804
我也不敢相信
Me, either.

552
00:20:16,804 --> 00:20:19,734
走吧 我们去买彩票
Come. Let's go get your lottery ticket.

553
00:20:26,384 --> 00:20:27,554
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

554
00:20:27,584 --> 00:20:28,814
我想你犯了个错误
I think you made a mistake here.

555
00:20:28,834 --> 00:20:30,424
我做错什么了
What did I do now?

556
00:20:30,454 --> 00:20:33,224
我数过了 只有96枚硬币
I counted these, and you've only got 96 pennies.

557
00:20:33,254 --> 00:20:34,294
你确定吗
Are you sure?

558
00:20:34,924 --> 00:20:36,584
恐怕是的
Afraid so.

559
00:20:36,894 --> 00:20:39,384
看来你得继续收集了
I guess you're gonna have to keep lookin'.

560
00:20:39,414 --> 00:20:41,414
见鬼 我数过了
Dang it! I counted those.

561
00:20:41,464 --> 00:20:43,465
你自己数数吧
See for yourself.

562
00:20:51,605 --> 00:20:53,805
现在上传你的照片
And now we upload your picture.

563
00:20:53,805 --> 00:20:55,845
有意思 有意思
This is fun. This is fun.

564
00:20:55,845 --> 00:20:57,105
稍微等一下
And in just a few short moments,

565
00:20:57,135 --> 00:20:58,965
拜神奇高科技所赐
thanks to the magic of technology...

566
00:20:58,985 --> 00:21:00,155
我们就会知道咱俩的孩子长啥样
We'll know what our baby actually looks--

567
00:21:00,185 --> 00:21:02,355
-不要 -怎么回事 这什么东西
- Oh! No! - What happened? What is that?

568
00:21:02,355 --> 00:21:03,895
你是把谁的照片传反了吗
Did you put one of us in upside-down?

569
00:21:03,925 --> 00:21:05,075
没有 这真是...
No! That's actually--

570
00:21:05,125 --> 00:21:06,545
别让我再看到这个
Okay, I-I don't want to see this anymore.

571
00:21:06,585 --> 00:21:07,565
快关掉
Ohh. Turn it off.

572
00:21:07,595 --> 00:21:08,695
关不掉
Oh, it's not turning off.

573
00:21:08,715 --> 00:21:10,465
快拿东西遮住 我的妈呀
Well, throw something over it! That--oh, god!

574
00:21:10,505 --> 00:21:12,766
我们扮演上帝的角色私自造人 瞧瞧可怕的后果吧
Yeah, well, we played god, and look what we brought forth.

575
00:21:12,806 --> 00:21:15,106
爸爸 你们在看什么
Daddies, what are you looking at?

576
00:21:18,376 --> 00:21:19,576
可能没那么糟
Maybe it wasn't that bad.

577
00:21:19,606 --> 00:21:21,096
可能是我们反应过激了
No, no, it's possible that we overreacted.

578
00:21:21,146 --> 00:21:23,676
对 可能是我们期望过高
Yeah. Maybe our expectations were just a little bit too high.

579
00:21:23,716 --> 00:21:25,386
那小家伙其实还有几分可爱
That little guy had some cute features. Huh?

580
00:21:25,416 --> 00:21:28,266
当然了 我俩的结合 不可能太糟
Of course he did. It's us. It can't be that bad.

581
00:21:28,306 --> 00:21:29,506
再瞄一眼
Let's just take--
